WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.410
- Hello, I'm Alvin.

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.030
And some of you guys
might have been wondering

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.880
of the new status on the
Making It Big season might be.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.560
And I'm excited to announce

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.340
that it is going to have a brand new host.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.910
Someone who is very
charismatic, passionate

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.400
and genuine about giant food
and is gonna be bringing

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.530
a lot of exciting new energy to the show.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.363
- What's up guys?

00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:22.500
My name is Tway and I'm the new host

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.600
of this season of Making It Big.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.920
You might have seen me online

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.320
sharing my easy to follow recipes

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.410
and I also host a lot of
delicious popups in real life.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.360
Now, I'm ready for the biggest

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.460
and most exciting food adventure yet.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.530
This season, my friends have challenged me

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.730
to make their favorite
food big and I mean big.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.370
Tune in and watch the new
season of Making It Big

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.800
because it's gonna be epic.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.270
- Thank you for supporting the show.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:51.120
Genuinely, it means a lot that
you guys have stuck with us,

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.000
commented, liked, shared
or simply just watched

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.950
the crazy shenanigans that we get up to.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.886
But I hope to look forward to many more.

00:00:58.886 --> 00:01:00.093
Peace.

